# Age Calculator

A simple Python age calculator that calculates your exact age using your birth date.

## Features

- Takes your birth year, month, and day as input
- Calculates your age in:
  - Years
  - Months
  - Days
- Calculates how many days you have been alive
- Handles different month lengths and leap years

## How to Run

Make sure you have Python installed.

